# Prisma / Database Rules

- **snake_case** for SQL column names, **PascalCase** model names.
- Each model schema should be in its own file inside `prisma/schema/`, with file name matching the model name (e.g. `User.prisma`).
- Main `schema.prisma` should use `// import` or similar strategy to include modular schema parts.
- Use `@relation` names explicitly; avoid implicit many-to-many.
- Keep schema comments up-to-date (`///`).
- Migrations: one per feature, never edit an applied migration.
- Data-access layer goes through **PrismaService** only; wrapped by repository pattern.

